WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:07.426
Your devices need operating funds to send reports and carry out
network activity. Let’s add those funds to your fleet.

2
00:00:08.010 --> 00:00:13.855
Choose Network budget. This balance covers device activity,
rather than your subscription allowance.

3
00:00:14.450 --> 00:00:18.866
Enter the amount to add. File and log storage have separate
funding controls.

4
00:00:19.450 --> 00:00:22.010
Review the deposit in your wallet, then approve it.

5
00:00:23.130 --> 00:00:30.106
Look for the confirmed deposit under Keep devices reporting.
Funding alone does not mean a device is online.

6
00:00:30.690 --> 00:00:36.770
The deposit is confirmed. Device health is checked separately.
Next, register your first device.
